WEBVTT

00:00:01.410 --> 00:00:06.040
Mitsuki-sensei has been kidnapped by the Indian Ocean Mermaid Princess.

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:10.490
Why would the mermaid of his memories, the one Sensei often talked about, do that?

00:00:10.490 --> 00:00:15.510
Gaito's lair has also disappeared, and the only clue is the Key of Sealing that was left behind.

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:20.250
But no matter what, we must find Mitsuki-sensei!

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:24.200
All right! Today again with our Pichi Pichi Voices, it's Live Start!

00:02:05.550 --> 00:02:13.170
A long time ago, the Panterassa wanted to conquer and wreak havoc on the seven oceans.

00:02:13.170 --> 00:02:17.870
Their actions stirred the wrath of Aqua Regina-sama, the sea deity that wished for peace.

00:02:17.870 --> 00:02:20.740
She suppressed their huge power,

00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:27.080
and with the Key of Sealing, she sealed Panterassa castle.

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:36.200
And then, I, Hippocampus, was entrusted the key by Aqua Regina-sama.

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:40.550
However, it was stolen by an unknown person, and the seal was lifted,

00:02:40.550 --> 00:02:44.120
reawakening Gaito's lair.

00:02:47.630 --> 00:02:50.350
Kaito's Nightmare.

00:02:56.740 --> 00:03:04.230
Could the one who revived Gaito's lair be the Indian Ocean Mermaid Princess, Sara?

00:03:04.230 --> 00:03:09.030
Besides, we never thought that Hippo was the legendary Hippocampus.

00:03:09.030 --> 00:03:11.390
You're right. I was really surprised.

00:03:11.390 --> 00:03:18.100
The Key of Sealing was stolen from me, so I wasn't able to transform into Hippocampus.

00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:20.770
But now that we've got the key,

00:03:20.770 --> 00:03:23.940
we'll be able to seal Gaito's lair once again, right?

00:03:23.940 --> 00:03:29.180
No. To suppress the power of the Panterassa, which has already started moving,

00:03:29.180 --> 00:03:33.820
we need to reawaken Aqua Regina-sama and borrow her powers.

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:37.740
Hippo! How could you be so clumsy and let the key get stolen!?

00:03:37.740 --> 00:03:41.290
If you had been more careful, this wouldn't have happened.

00:03:41.290 --> 00:03:44.460
Also, the peace of the oceans has been shattered!

00:03:44.460 --> 00:03:45.120
Hanon.

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:49.050
Tarou-chan wouldn't have been taken to Gaito's lair, either!

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:52.030
Hippo, give Tarou-chan back to me!

00:03:52.030 --> 00:03:53.960
Give him back now!

00:03:54.280 --> 00:03:55.430
Give him back!

00:03:55.430 --> 00:03:56.280
Give him back!!

00:03:56.280 --> 00:04:00.130
Hey, Hanon, don't blame everything on him.

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:01.460
Stupid Hippo!

00:04:01.460 --> 00:04:02.170
Hanon!

00:04:02.460 --> 00:04:04.010
I'm sorry, Hippo.

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:07.010
Hanon is a little worked up now, so forgive her, okay?

00:04:07.360 --> 00:04:10.180
No. It's just as Hanon-san said.

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:13.670
It's all my fault for allowing the key to get stolen.

00:04:13.670 --> 00:04:14.790
Hippo.

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:29.770
Mitsuki. You'll live in this castle at the bottom of the sea for the rest of your life.

00:04:29.770 --> 00:04:32.920
And eternally play the piano.

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:50.350
Why? Why when I hear this piano...

00:04:56.380 --> 00:04:59.660
Why do I keep remembering those days?

00:05:01.370 --> 00:05:03.280
Why does that still happen!?

00:05:05.960 --> 00:05:10.220
You'll play the piano here for the rest of your life!

00:05:17.090 --> 00:05:23.630
To make sure that Sara's heart is mine, I need to obtain the powers of my other self no matter what.

00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:25.850
Is that you, Sara?

00:05:26.350 --> 00:05:30.900
Gaito, what are you thinking about while gazing at the Mermaid Princesses?

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:33.240
Of course, I would think of you.

00:05:33.240 --> 00:05:35.720
Me? Are you sure?

00:05:35.720 --> 00:05:39.610
Soon, I will be able to deliver the present that I promised you.

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:41.470
Soon?

00:05:41.470 --> 00:05:43.050
Are you pleased?

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:45.950
Of course, Gaito.

00:05:46.230 --> 00:05:48.710
Please look forward to it, Sara.

00:05:55.840 --> 00:06:00.900
Does your present self really have that power, Gaito?

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:03.590
Ah, Gaito-sama.

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:06.010
Sheshe, Mimi.

00:06:06.330 --> 00:06:08.690
I will be in seclusion in my room for a while.

00:06:08.690 --> 00:06:10.050
Don't let anyone disturb me.

00:06:11.460 --> 00:06:14.290
I'm making preparations to surface my castle.

00:06:14.650 --> 00:06:17.430
Well then, it's almost time for us to conquer the surface.

00:06:17.430 --> 00:06:21.470
But then, Gaito-sama, to conquer the chaotic surface...

00:06:21.470 --> 00:06:25.280
I have to take command of the surface, so that I don't lose what's precious to me.

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:29.180
Oh my. What is that precious thing, Gaito-sama?

00:06:29.720 --> 00:06:32.730
Don't tell me it's the woman called "Sara".

00:06:37.400 --> 00:06:40.430
You just keep quiet and follow my orders!

00:06:40.430 --> 00:06:43.070
All you need to do is prepare for battle.

00:06:44.690 --> 00:06:46.850
Sister Mimi, are you alright!?

00:06:46.850 --> 00:06:48.280
That hurt!

00:06:48.280 --> 00:06:50.710
Why did I have to be slapped!?

00:06:51.150 --> 00:06:57.940
Hey, Sister Mimi. Don't you think Gaito has a shorter temper than we thought?

00:06:57.940 --> 00:06:59.490
How true.

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:05.970
Having his heart snatched by that kind of woman, he's no longer fit to be ruler of the sea.

00:07:05.970 --> 00:07:08.780
It would seem that it's meaningless for us to stay here.

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:10.370
Sister Sheshe.

00:07:10.370 --> 00:07:15.440
Let's leave Gaito and act on our own, Sister Mimi.

00:07:15.440 --> 00:07:16.750
On our own?

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:22.180
Yes. If we gather the seven pearls, our goal will be completed.

00:07:22.180 --> 00:07:23.480
I see.

00:07:23.480 --> 00:07:28.720
At that point, we won't depend on Gaito, and we can become rulers of the sea.

00:07:28.720 --> 00:07:32.040
As Gaito said, he'll be in seclusion in his room.

00:07:32.040 --> 00:07:34.550
Let's proceed with our plans, shall we?

00:07:34.550 --> 00:07:37.860
Yes, let's do that, Sister Sheshe.

00:07:45.300 --> 00:07:49.290
That Hanon... going to find Gaito's lair all by herself.

00:07:49.290 --> 00:07:52.170
She should know it's dangerous to do that.

00:07:52.500 --> 00:07:53.770
Hanon!

00:07:53.770 --> 00:07:54.880
Hanon!

00:07:54.880 --> 00:07:59.200
Don't tell me that Hanon's been captured by the minions in Gaito's lair.

00:08:02.510 --> 00:08:04.000
I found her. Over there!

00:08:04.190 --> 00:08:05.930
Hanon? She's over there?

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:08.900
Hanon! Wait a second!

00:08:09.530 --> 00:08:11.610
You don't have a clue where Gaito's lair is.

00:08:11.610 --> 00:08:13.790
How are you going to find it, Hanon?

00:08:13.790 --> 00:08:19.940
Either I look for Gaito's lair, or wait until they come out and find me.

00:08:19.940 --> 00:08:22.460
That's too dangerous, Hanon.

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:24.110
There's no other way!

00:08:24.110 --> 00:08:28.740
Hanon, I understand your feelings, but you should calm down and-

00:08:28.740 --> 00:08:31.670
Tarou-chan was taken to Gaito's lair!

00:08:32.170 --> 00:08:36.590
And it was done by the Indian Ocean Mermaid Princess from his memories!

00:08:36.590 --> 00:08:38.260
How can I calm down!?

00:08:38.530 --> 00:08:39.940
Hey, Hanon!

00:08:40.260 --> 00:08:41.470
Wait up!

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:05.950
Father...

00:09:11.300 --> 00:09:14.400
I wasn't Father and Mother's child.

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:17.240
Whose child am I exactly?

00:09:26.860 --> 00:09:30.900
T-This is... What on earth happened?

00:09:31.760 --> 00:09:33.170
That voice is...

00:09:34.590 --> 00:09:36.070
It's you again!

00:09:36.070 --> 00:09:38.160
Why do you keep appearing!?

00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:41.950
Why didn't you protect what's precious to you?

00:09:41.950 --> 00:09:46.340
You appeared only to say the same thing again, huh!?

00:09:46.340 --> 00:09:49.410
No, I came to fetch you.

00:09:49.930 --> 00:09:51.190
Fetch me?

00:09:52.740 --> 00:09:54.230
My other self.

00:09:54.230 --> 00:09:56.410
"My other self"...

00:09:56.890 --> 00:09:58.510
What's the meaning of this!?

00:09:58.510 --> 00:10:04.440
In order to gain the power to protect what's precious to you, let us join and become one.

00:10:04.440 --> 00:10:06.510
I don't understand what you're talking about!

00:10:06.510 --> 00:10:08.520
Someday you'll understand.

00:10:09.550 --> 00:10:10.980
W-Wait!

00:10:16.650 --> 00:10:18.030
Kaito...

00:10:18.030 --> 00:10:19.350
Kaito.

00:10:19.350 --> 00:10:20.500
Kaito!

00:10:20.500 --> 00:10:21.710
Kaito!!

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:25.110
Get a hold of yourself, Kaito!

00:10:26.400 --> 00:10:27.530
Are you awake?

00:10:27.960 --> 00:10:29.090
Lucia...

00:10:29.090 --> 00:10:30.750
Are you alright, Kaito!?

00:10:30.750 --> 00:10:31.800
Lucia, you...

00:10:31.800 --> 00:10:34.120
Geez, don't frighten me.

00:10:34.120 --> 00:10:36.570
Lucia, why are you here?

00:10:36.570 --> 00:10:39.940
I came to Hawaii because I was worried about you.

00:10:39.940 --> 00:10:43.160
Then all of a sudden, I saw you drowning in the ocean.

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:48.600
Why didn't you protect what's precious to you?

00:10:49.060 --> 00:10:50.540
My other self.

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:53.580
What's wrong, Kaito?

00:10:54.030 --> 00:10:54.820
It's nothing.

00:10:55.250 --> 00:10:58.550
Thank goodness, Lucia. It's great that we came to Hawaii.

00:10:58.550 --> 00:11:01.840
As I thought. Without me, you're hopeless, Kaito.

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:03.240
Shut up. Leave me alone.

00:11:04.210 --> 00:11:08.050
You all came to Hawaii, so won't school be affected?

00:11:08.050 --> 00:11:10.530
Even if Hanon and I take a break from school,

00:11:10.530 --> 00:11:13.130
we can catch up quickly in our studies, so it's alright.

00:11:13.130 --> 00:11:15.660
But then Lucia will get more stupid.

00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:16.760
You're right.

00:11:16.940 --> 00:11:19.440
What? You two are mean.

00:11:24.010 --> 00:11:24.960
What's that?

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:32.560
Kaito!

00:11:42.300 --> 00:11:44.290
Let's get to a safe place!

00:11:45.570 --> 00:11:46.670
Kaito!

00:11:46.670 --> 00:11:47.590
Hurry up!

00:11:48.290 --> 00:11:53.910
In order to gain the power to protect what's precious to you, let us join and become one.

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:15.780
Rina, Hanon!

00:12:16.160 --> 00:12:18.250
No!

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:27.810
My other self... To gain the power...

00:12:27.810 --> 00:12:30.050
...let us join and become one...

00:12:36.010 --> 00:12:38.910
Right now, Gaito-sama is in seclusion in his room.

00:12:39.300 --> 00:12:43.330
How true. Now's our chance to snatch the pearls.

00:12:51.320 --> 00:12:56.660
The next step to our plan is to obtain the remaining five Mermaid Princesses' pearls.

00:12:56.660 --> 00:12:59.530
And then the seven seas will belong to us.

00:13:00.030 --> 00:13:01.700
How true.

00:13:01.700 --> 00:13:04.550
We should've done this earlier.

00:13:04.890 --> 00:13:07.040
The world is waiting for us.

00:13:07.040 --> 00:13:10.860
Well then, Sister Mimi. Let's quickly say goodbye to this castle.

00:13:10.860 --> 00:13:13.300
How true, Sister Sheshe.

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:18.200
It's the Black Beauty Sisters.

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:23.680
What are they going to do by taking the Mermaid Princesses' pearls?

00:13:23.680 --> 00:13:27.290
Say, should we report this to Gaito-sama?

00:13:27.290 --> 00:13:32.630
We shouldn't. Gaito-sama said that no one is allowed to disturb him while he's in his room.

00:13:32.630 --> 00:13:33.880
You're right.

00:13:33.880 --> 00:13:37.830
I guess there's a need for us to investigate this ourselves.

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:39.620
Let's follow them.

00:13:39.620 --> 00:13:40.200
Yeah.

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:53.910
I vow before the setting sun that I will find Gaito's lair and save Mitsuki-san.

00:13:53.910 --> 00:13:57.030
Even if I have to sacrifice my life.

00:13:57.030 --> 00:13:58.890
You can't do that, Hippo!

00:13:58.890 --> 00:14:00.490
Don't be reckless.

00:14:00.490 --> 00:14:03.710
But I've been thinking about how Hanon-san feels.

00:14:03.710 --> 00:14:10.110
Hippo, Hanon should know already that it's not entirely your fault.

00:14:16.860 --> 00:14:20.030
I wonder what Kaito's doing right now.

00:14:20.030 --> 00:14:24.250
He must be living it up and having fun surfing Hawaii's big waves.

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:28.470
That would be great, but he hasn't sent me any letters.

00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:31.970
I can't call him either. I'm getting a little worried.

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:35.350
Kaito... I hope he isn't sick.

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:40.140
You haven't given any thought about Tarou-chan, have you.

00:14:40.830 --> 00:14:41.520
Hanon!

00:14:41.520 --> 00:14:42.730
H-Hanon-san!

00:14:42.730 --> 00:14:46.480
Well, I guess that makes sense. Lucia worries about Kaito-kun.

00:14:46.950 --> 00:14:50.060
She won't care about what happens to Tarou-chan.

00:14:50.060 --> 00:14:51.790
That's not true, Hanon!

00:14:51.790 --> 00:14:53.700
I do care about Mitsuki-sensei-

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:56.080
Don't say anything if all you have are hollow words!

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:59.230
Rina, tell the school that I'll be taking a break starting tomorrow.

00:14:59.230 --> 00:15:01.290
I'm going to be looking for Gaito's lair. Thanks.

00:15:02.630 --> 00:15:04.590
Hanon! Wait a second!

00:15:04.590 --> 00:15:05.950
Hey, wait up, Hanon!

00:15:09.030 --> 00:15:10.350
It's my fault!

00:15:10.350 --> 00:15:13.900
It's my fault that their relationship is in ruins!

00:15:13.900 --> 00:15:16.140
I need to do something about this quickly.

00:15:19.570 --> 00:15:25.850
T-This is a response from the Mermaid Princesses' pearls that were taken to Gaito's castle.

00:15:25.850 --> 00:15:27.310
No doubt about it.

00:15:29.770 --> 00:15:35.390
I have to move quickly to save Tarou-chan from the Indian Ocean Mermaid Princess.

00:15:35.390 --> 00:15:37.870
Tarou-chan, where are you!?

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:39.200
Tarou-chan!

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:46.010
Hanon's that desperate to be looking for Mitsuki-sensei.

00:15:46.010 --> 00:15:52.040
But even if we find Gaito's lair, it won't be easy to save Mitsuki-sensei.

00:15:52.040 --> 00:15:55.590
We have to at least watch over Hanon, so that she doesn't go wild.

00:15:59.030 --> 00:16:02.470
The response from the pearls should be somewhere over here...

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:07.090
That's the Black Beauty Sisters.

00:16:10.230 --> 00:16:13.220
While we were following the Black Beauty Sisters...

00:16:13.220 --> 00:16:15.500
We certainly made an unexpected catch.

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:20.650
I never thought we would meet the legendary Hippocampus here.

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:25.930
Stupid Hippocampus-san. You can't get away now.

00:16:25.930 --> 00:16:28.330
Y-Yuuri-san...

00:16:28.330 --> 00:16:32.710
You should know where the Mermaid Princesses are.

00:16:32.710 --> 00:16:37.090
Well then, we'll make you tell us everything.

00:16:37.090 --> 00:16:38.370
Stop this!

00:16:38.370 --> 00:16:39.270
Hippo!

00:16:39.270 --> 00:16:40.820
What's wrong, Lucia?

00:16:40.820 --> 00:16:43.760
I just heard a scream from Hippocampus.

00:16:43.760 --> 00:16:44.600
Hippo?

00:16:44.600 --> 00:16:46.070
Hanon, wait a moment.

00:16:46.070 --> 00:16:47.520
Hippo might be in trouble.

00:16:47.520 --> 00:16:49.230
I don't care about Hippo.

00:16:49.700 --> 00:16:52.420
He's probably being chased by sharks, right?

00:16:52.420 --> 00:16:56.480
Hanon, Hippo might have found Gaito's lair.

00:16:56.480 --> 00:16:58.730
Eh? Gaito's lair?

00:17:06.030 --> 00:17:07.670
How's that? Does it hurt?

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:09.680
That kelp will slowly tighten.

00:17:11.520 --> 00:17:14.520
Hurry up and tell us where the Mermaid Princesses are.

00:17:14.520 --> 00:17:16.750
Let go of Hippocampus!

00:17:21.290 --> 00:17:23.190
Pink Pearl Voice!

00:17:23.800 --> 00:17:25.790
Aqua Pearl Voice!

00:17:26.570 --> 00:17:28.470
Green Pearl Voice!

00:17:44.460 --> 00:17:47.470
The Mermaid Princesses have appeared, huh?

00:17:47.470 --> 00:17:50.290
Winter mermaids swim into the fire on their own accord, right?

00:17:50.290 --> 00:17:52.730
I won't let you sing.

00:17:52.730 --> 00:17:55.580
If you try to sing, we'll do this to Hippocampus.

00:17:58.520 --> 00:17:59.440
Stop it!

00:17:59.780 --> 00:18:05.400
So, Mermaid Princess-sama. Be obedient and let us capture you.

00:18:05.400 --> 00:18:07.090
Everyone, don't give in!

00:18:07.090 --> 00:18:09.160
Don't worry about me and sing!

00:18:09.160 --> 00:18:09.960
Shut up!

00:18:12.020 --> 00:18:13.770
W-What should we do?

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:20.490
K-Karen-san. Thanks a lot.

00:18:20.750 --> 00:18:22.550
Purple Pearl Voice!

00:18:24.800 --> 00:18:28.600
We won't forgive you for using a battle plan that takes hostages!

00:18:28.600 --> 00:18:30.550
Pichi Pichi Voice Live Start!

00:19:00.790 --> 00:19:02.040
It hurts!

00:19:08.760 --> 00:19:10.660
Stop it!

00:19:42.250 --> 00:19:44.410
We were so close...

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:46.940
A chance like this won't happen again!

00:19:46.940 --> 00:19:49.710
I hate it, no matter how many times I hear it!

00:19:49.710 --> 00:19:50.740
It hurts!

00:19:51.300 --> 00:19:53.470
Love Shower Pitch!

00:19:56.090 --> 00:19:57.180
How about an encore?

00:19:57.560 --> 00:19:58.700
Damn you...

00:19:58.700 --> 00:20:00.430
Remember this!

00:20:09.380 --> 00:20:12.490
It's no good, Kaito... I can't run anymore.

00:20:12.490 --> 00:20:14.120
Don't give up, Lucia.

00:20:14.120 --> 00:20:15.460
I'll protect you!

00:20:15.460 --> 00:20:16.610
Protect me...

00:20:16.610 --> 00:20:18.600
What exactly can you do to protect me, Kaito?

00:20:19.650 --> 00:20:23.000
Don't you wish for power to protect what's precious to you?

00:20:28.340 --> 00:20:30.270
Don't let go, Lucia.

00:20:30.270 --> 00:20:31.250
Kaito.

00:20:31.690 --> 00:20:35.440
Don't you wish for power to protect what's precious to you?

00:20:39.600 --> 00:20:42.020
Lucia!

00:20:42.330 --> 00:20:44.900
Come, my other self.

00:20:44.900 --> 00:20:48.540
If you want the power, come over to my side.

00:20:50.320 --> 00:20:55.370
Give me the power... to protect what's precious to me.

00:21:17.310 --> 00:21:20.220
Hippo, didn't I tell you not to act recklessly?

00:21:20.220 --> 00:21:21.830
I'm sorry, Lucia-san.

00:21:21.830 --> 00:21:27.420
But I got a response from the Mermaid Princesses' pearls that were taken to Gaito's lair.

00:21:27.420 --> 00:21:29.300
So I tried to follow it.

00:21:29.300 --> 00:21:32.240
What on earth does that mean, Hippo?

00:21:32.240 --> 00:21:33.450
I don't know...

00:21:33.450 --> 00:21:38.710
When I thought I found the Black Beauty Sisters, I was captured by the Dark Lovers.

00:21:38.710 --> 00:21:40.870
I wonder what's going on in Gaito's lair.

00:21:41.600 --> 00:21:42.640
Lucia.

00:21:43.120 --> 00:21:43.830
Kaito?

00:21:44.210 --> 00:21:45.800
What's wrong, Lucia?

00:21:45.800 --> 00:21:48.560
Just now... I heard Kaito's voice just now.

00:21:48.560 --> 00:21:50.600
I didn't hear anything, though.

00:21:50.600 --> 00:21:51.850
Me neither.

00:21:51.850 --> 00:21:53.500
Could it be your imagination?

00:21:53.500 --> 00:21:57.860
I'm sure I heard Kaito's voice calling for me.

00:21:59.700 --> 00:22:00.720
Kaito.

00:22:07.330 --> 00:22:10.100
Welcome back, my other self.

00:22:15.330 --> 00:22:17.910
Welcome to my castle.

00:23:50.800 --> 00:23:53.780
It seems the Mermaid Princesses weren't really that great.

00:23:53.780 --> 00:23:55.200
How true.

00:23:55.200 --> 00:23:59.550
Using powers of the two pearls we took from the Gaito's lair,

00:23:59.550 --> 00:24:03.790
we've now obtained the pink, aqua, green, and purple pearls.

00:24:03.790 --> 00:24:09.010
Even if we didn't initially rely on Gaito's power, we would've been enough to obtain every pearl.

00:24:09.010 --> 00:24:13.460
Soon, the seven seas of the world will belong to us!

00:24:13.460 --> 00:24:16.200
Next time on Mermaid Melody Pichi Pichi Pitch:

00:24:16.200 --> 00:24:17.160
The Beat.

00:24:17.160 --> 00:24:19.280
How about some black temptation?
